{"seq":1,"slug":"customization-business-models-channels","title":"定制商业模式与渠道分布（POD / MTO / ETO / CPQ 的边界与取舍）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/customization-model-option-variants/customization-business-models-channels","wordCount":2736,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"定制商业模式与渠道分布-pod-mto-eto-cpq-的边界与取舍\">定制商业模式与渠道分布（POD / MTO / ETO / CPQ 的边界与取舍）</h1><p>「定制」被四种完全不同的商业契约共用：印刷厂按你上传的图案印一件 T 恤、家具厂按你选的木色拼一张桌子、工程公司按你的图纸造一台非标设备、企业软件按你勾选的模块生成报价单——消费者体感相似，但<strong>生产触发点、库存责任、定价时刻、退货义务</strong>四项完全不同。混成一个「定制」字段，是配置器系统后期失控的常见起点。本文给出四种模式的判定边界与跨境渠道下的合规约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-生产触发点决定一切\">核心概念：生产触发点决定一切</h2><p>制造业用**解耦点（decoupling point）**描述供应链从「按预测备货」切到「按订单生产」的位置（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Build_to_order\">Wikipedia: Build to order</a>）。四种定制模式的区别，本质就是这个点在产品结构树上的位置——越靠上游，交付越慢、越独特、越不可退。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>生产触发</th>\n<th>库存责任</th>\n<th>典型交期</th>\n<th>可配置空间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MTS</td>\n<td>Make-to-Stock 备货生产</td>\n<td>预测</td>\n<td>成品</td>\n<td>立即发货</td>\n<td>无（仅 SKU）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>POD</td>\n<td>Print-on-Demand 按需印刷</td>\n<td>订单后逐件触发</td>\n<td>仅空基材</td>\n<td>生产数日 + 物流</td>\n<td>图案/文字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATO/CTO</td>\n<td>Assemble/Configure-to-Order</td>\n<td>订单后组装</td>\n<td>半成品部件</td>\n<td>组装周期 + 物流</td>\n<td>预定义选项组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MTO</td>\n<td>Make-to-Order 按单生产</td>\n<td>订单后制造</td>\n<td>原材料</td>\n<td>排产周期 + 物流</td>\n<td>尺寸/材质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ETO</td>\n<td>Engineer-to-Order 按单设计</td>\n<td>订单后先设计再制造</td>\n<td>原材料</td>\n<td>设计 + 制造 + 物流</td>\n<td>设计本身可变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[客户需求] --&gt; D{设计是否已定义?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| ETO[ETO 按单设计&lt;br/&gt;设计进入交期]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F{是否需逐件制造/装配?}&#10;  F --&gt;|仅图案或表层| POD[POD 按需印刷&lt;br/&gt;空基材库存]&#10;  F --&gt;|预定义选项组合| CTO[CTO/ATO 按单配置&lt;br/&gt;模块化 BOM]&#10;  F --&gt;|尺寸材质可变| MTO[MTO 按单生产&lt;br/&gt;设计既定]&#10;  F --&gt;|无需定制| MTS[MTS 备货]&#10;  ETO --&gt; PR[逐件生产触发]&#10;  POD --&gt; PR&#10;  CTO --&gt; PR&#10;  MTO --&gt; PR\">graph TD\n  Q[客户需求] --&gt; D{设计是否已定义?}\n  D --&gt;|否| ETO[ETO 按单设计&lt;br/&gt;设计进入交期]\n  D --&gt;|是| F{是否需逐件制造/装配?}\n  F --&gt;|仅图案或表层| POD[POD 按需印刷&lt;br/&gt;空基材库存]\n  F --&gt;|预定义选项组合| CTO[CTO/ATO 按单配置&lt;br/&gt;模块化 BOM]\n  F --&gt;|尺寸材质可变| MTO[MTO 按单生产&lt;br/&gt;设计既定]\n  F --&gt;|无需定制| MTS[MTS 备货]\n  ETO --&gt; PR[逐件生产触发]\n  POD --&gt; PR\n  CTO --&gt; PR\n  MTO --&gt; PR</pre><p>判定顺序很重要：先问<strong>设计是否随订单产生</strong>（分离 ETO），再问<strong>是否逐件触发生产</strong>（分离 POD/MTO/CTO 与 MTS），最后问<strong>可配置空间是否被预定义枚举</strong>（分离 CTO 与 MTO）。它直接映射到数据模型：ETO 需要「设计版本」实体，CTO 需要「选项/约束」实体，POD 需要「逐件生产工单」。</p>\n<p><strong>库存责任差异就是成本结构差异。</strong> POD 每件单价更高（无批量折扣），但消灭了滞销库存与打折清货。设售价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、单件可变成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、运费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、平台费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、滞销率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、持有成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，期望单件贡献粗略为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>POD</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>MTS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{POD}} = p - (c_u + c_s + f), \\qquad\n\\pi_{\\text{MTS}} = (1-\\lambda)\\big(p - f\\big) - c_u - c_s - c_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">POD</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MTS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>POD 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p - c_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 更薄，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_h \\approx 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6331em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。这解释了 POD 适合<strong>长尾、不确定、低客单</strong>的 SKU，MTS 适合<strong>高确定性、高周转</strong>的爆款。规模上，Shopify 报告全球按需印刷市场 2026 年达 131 亿美元，预计到 2033 年以 23.6% 年率增长（<a href=\"https://www.shopify.com/blog/print-on-demand\">Shopify</a>）；其履约链条是「卖家出设计 → 挂店铺 → 订单转发生产伙伴 → 伙伴印刷发货」，中间<strong>没有商家自身的仓</strong>，这正是 POD 与 MTS 的工程分界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pod-零库存的按单触发生产\">POD：零库存的按单触发生产</h2><p>POD 的技术底座是数字印刷：单件取代胶印才让书刊按需印刷经济，服装侧的直接成衣印花（DTG）去掉了制版晒网环节（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Print_on_demand\">Wikipedia: Print on demand</a>）。对系统的含义是<strong>生产单元可小到 1 件且启动成本近零</strong>，「订单」成为生产触发的最小单元。必须建模三样东西：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可印区与安全区</strong>：每件基材有坐标化可印范围与线宽/出血规则，超出则在印刷端裁切或拒绝。</li>\n<li><strong>生产伙伴路由</strong>：同一订单可能拆给不同伙伴，依据覆盖商品、国家、产能与运费。Gelato 宣称覆盖 32 国 140+ 印花厂，路由目标是<strong>就近生产缩短最后一公里</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>逐件生产工单与状态机</strong>：<code>待生产 → 已排产 → 已印刷 → 已发货</code>，工单与订单行一一对应。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>路由是一个受约束的最小化：候选伙伴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，伙伴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 对订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 到岸成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，交付上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>j</mi><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\*</mtext></mstyle></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j^\\* = \\arg\\min_{j \\in P} \\; c_{ij} \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad t_{ij} \\le T, \\; \\text{cap}_j \\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\*</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5483em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0636em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际系统还要叠加可印性与合规约束。<strong>低运费常意味着慢</strong>——Shopify 提醒便宜物流可能让客户「等三周」，故交期承诺必须显式包含生产时间，而非只报承运商时效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mto-与-cto-既有设计下的配置化生产\">MTO 与 CTO：既有设计下的配置化生产</h2><p>两者共同点是<strong>设计已经存在</strong>，订单只选择参数。MTO 允许尺寸/材质变化，CTO 从<strong>预定义选项与模块</strong>组合——SAP 称之为变式配置（variant configuration），其组件清单与工艺路线可由配置结果<strong>自动生成</strong>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Engineer_to_order\">Wikipedia: Engineer to order</a>）。CTO 是配置器产品的核心战场：选项有限且已知，才能做引导式销售与实时定价。工程分界在<strong>约束来源</strong>：组合空间小且能被规则闭合 → CTO；参数连续或需几何校验 → MTO（配置器退化为报价单收集器）；两者混合则用「参数作为特殊选项」建模，但在校验层区分。</p>\n<p>CTO 实例化 BOM 可抽象为：给定配置向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">o</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{o} = (o_1, \\dots, o_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>valid</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>BOM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">o</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>expand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{valid}(\\mathbf{o}) = \\bigwedge_{r \\in R} r(\\mathbf{o}), \\qquad\n\\text{BOM}(\\mathbf{o}) = \\bigcup_{o_k \\in \\mathbf{o}} \\text{expand}(o_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BOM</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4059em;vertical-align:-1.3559em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathbf mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋃</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">expand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这与产品目录结构强耦合，<a href=\"configurable-product-catalog-data-model\">可配置商品目录数据模型</a>展开了选项、变式与 BOM 的存储结构及其与规则引擎的衔接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eto-设计随订单开始\">ETO：设计随订单开始</h2><p>ETO 与 MTO 的唯一分界是<strong>设计活动是否计入交期</strong>：MTO 生产者已握有既定设计与规格，ETO 在收到订单后才开展全部或部分设计（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Engineer_to_order\">Wikipedia: Engineer to order</a>）。典型行业是定制工业机械、专用飞机、企业软件、按图施工工程。对系统有三个硬性差异：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>报价不能自动定价</strong>——设计未知则成本未知，报价是带有效期的估算；配置器在 ETO 场景是「需求采集器」而非「价格计算器」。</li>\n<li><strong>交期是区间而非点</strong>——承诺须是「设计确认后 N 周制造」这类条件式 SLA。</li>\n<li><strong>变更管理是核心实体</strong>——订单生命周期由工程变更单（ECO）驱动，价格与交期随变更重算。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"cpq-与配置器的边界与选型\">CPQ 与配置器的边界与选型</h2><p>CPQ（Configure, Price, Quote）覆盖「配置 → 定价 → 报价」三段，配置器只覆盖第一段。配置器作为知识型 AI 应用早于电商：Digital 的 R1/XCON 是早期规则型配置系统，知识型配置依赖约束满足、布尔可满足性等求解技术（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Product_configurator\">Wikipedia: Product configurator</a>）。Wiki 称配置生命周期管理（CLM）是 CPQ 的上位概念，可支撑大规模定制（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Configure,_price_and_quote\">Wikipedia: CPQ</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>纯配置器</th>\n<th>CPQ</th>\n<th>B2B 报价系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选项/约束校验</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时定价</td>\n<td>有时</td>\n<td>✅（含协议价/折扣）</td>\n<td>✅（人工审批）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报价文档与审批流</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐件生产触发</td>\n<td>视 POD 而定</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要用户</td>\n<td>消费者</td>\n<td>销售/渠道</td>\n<td>销售/财务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分岔点不是功能多少，而是<strong>谁在配置</strong>：消费者自助 → 配置器（体验与实时反馈优先）；销售代客 → CPQ（折扣权限、审批、合同版本优先）。CPQ 市场被描述为「高度分散」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Configure,_price_and_quote\">Wikipedia: CPQ</a>），集成策略由此得出：<strong>把配置引擎当可替换组件</strong>，用自有窄接口包住第三方定价能力，避免厂商锁定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道分布-同一模式的多渠道差异\">渠道分布：同一模式的多渠道差异</h2><p>同一种定制模式在不同渠道的合规与履约责任并不相同，这是跨境定制最易踩坑之处。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>定制触点</th>\n<th>生产/发货方</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>D2C 独立站</td>\n<td>站内配置器</td>\n<td>自有或 POD 伙伴</td>\n<td>交期承诺、退货例外举证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台（如 Amazon Merch）</td>\n<td>平台内设计上传</td>\n<td>平台生产网络</td>\n<td>平台政策与版税分成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制 SaaS / 白标</td>\n<td>卖家的卖家</td>\n<td>伙伴网络</td>\n<td>多渠道工单同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B2B / 经销商 CPQ</td>\n<td>销售代客配置</td>\n<td>自有产线</td>\n<td>协议价、审批、合同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心是<strong>谁承担生产责任</strong>。平台模式下卖家只出设计，印刷发货乃至退货由平台伙伴处理，卖家系统重点是设计资产与版税结算；D2C+POD 伙伴模式下商家仍是<strong>对消费者的责任方</strong>，生产工单、交期与合规标签都须由商家系统兜底。</p>\n<p>跨境渠道还叠加进口成本变化：美国 2025 年通过行政令终结低值包裹免税待遇（Section 321 de minimis），先对中国商品自 2025-05-02 生效，随后将全球商业包裹豁免关闭提前至 2025-08-29（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/De_minimis\">Wikipedia: De minimis</a>），这直接推动 POD 就近生产以绕开关税链条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规与退货边界\">合规与退货边界</h2><p>定制模式的法律后果集中在<strong>撤回权例外</strong>。欧盟《消费者权利指令》2011/83/EU 第 16 条列举不适用 14 天撤回权的情形，其中 (c) 项为「按消费者规格制造或明显个性化的商品」（goods made to the consumer&#39;s specifications or clearly personalised）（<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/16\">legislation.gov.uk: Art.16</a>）；欧盟消费者指引也把「定做或明显个性化的商品，如定制西装」列为冷静期例外（<a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/returns/index_en.htm\">Your Europe: Returns</a>）。要吃这个例外，系统必须能<strong>举证商品确为个性化</strong>——设计稿版本、配置快照、下单参数都要留存。</p>\n<p>美国方向并不对称：FTC《邮购、互联网或电话订购商品规则》要求有明确承诺时按承诺发货，无承诺时<strong>默认 30 天内</strong>发货，延迟须通知并给出「等待或退款」的选择（<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/business-guide-ftcs-mail-internet-or-telephone-order-merchandise-rule\">FTC: Merchandise Rule</a>）。该指引<strong>并未</strong>为定制品豁免 30 天规则，故定制生产周期须纳入可预期的发货承诺并留存依据。</p>\n<p>面向欧盟的定制品还须满足《通用产品安全条例》(EU) 2023/988（自 <strong>2024-12-13</strong> 适用）：距离销售者须展示制造商或欧盟授权代表身份与产品识别信息，产品须带批次/序列识别码及制造商地址（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">Wikipedia: GPSR</a>）。这对 POD 是实质约束：<strong>每件定制品的生产者身份与批次必须可追溯</strong>，逐件工单天然就是追溯的最小单元。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>判定顺序：<strong>设计是否随订单产生</strong>（ETO）→ <strong>是否逐件触发生产</strong>（POD/MTO/CTO vs MTS）→ <strong>可配置空间是否被预定义枚举</strong>（CTO vs MTO）。</li>\n<li>POD 的工程核心是逐件生产工单 + 就近生产路由 + 交期含生产时间；零库存不等于零责任。</li>\n<li>CTO 靠选项/约束闭合组合空间，MTO 靠工程校验处理连续参数，ETO 的记录中心是工程变更单。</li>\n<li>配置器与 CPQ 的分岔是<strong>谁在配置</strong>；配置引擎应作可替换组件。</li>\n<li>撤回权例外（EU Art.16(c)）需要可举证的定制品证据链；美国 FTC 30 天规则对定制品<strong>不豁免</strong>；EU GPSR 要求逐件可追溯。</li>\n<li>模式应是配置项而非硬编码分支：同一 SKU 可能先从 CTO 渠道售卖、后切 ETO，数据模型与规则引擎不应因此重写。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定制商业模式与渠道分布（POD / MTO / ETO / CPQ 的边界与取舍）","id":"定制商业模式与渠道分布-pod-mto-eto-cpq-的边界与取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：生产触发点决定一切","id":"核心概念-生产触发点决定一切"},{"level":2,"text":"POD：零库存的按单触发生产","id":"pod-零库存的按单触发生产"},{"level":2,"text":"MTO 与 CTO：既有设计下的配置化生产","id":"mto-与-cto-既有设计下的配置化生产"},{"level":2,"text":"ETO：设计随订单开始","id":"eto-设计随订单开始"},{"level":2,"text":"CPQ 与配置器的边界与选型","id":"cpq-与配置器的边界与选型"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道分布：同一模式的多渠道差异","id":"渠道分布-同一模式的多渠道差异"},{"level":2,"text":"合规与退货边界","id":"合规与退货边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"选项组、变体矩阵与 SKU 爆炸治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/customization-model-option-variants/option-group-variant-matrix-sku-explosion"}}